      "https://bxedpdmgvgatjdfxgxij.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/questoes/revalida/2016/observe-o-partograma-abaixo-referente-a-primigesta-38-semana-01.webp"
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "A",
