      "https://bxedpdmgvgatjdfxgxij.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/questoes/revalida/2017/parturiente-de-38-semanas-2g-1p-normal-ha-3-anos-em-trabalho-01.webp"
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "A",
