    "correct_answer": "D",
    "commentary": "Solução\nGabarito: D) Pressão suprapúbica e hiperflexão de pernas.\n6.22 Referências Bibliográficas\n1. MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE. Diretriz Nacional de Assistência ao Parto Normal. Brasília, DF: MS,\n2022.\n2. Filho, Agnaldo Lopes da, S. et al. Tratado de Obstetrícia. Available from: VitalSource\nBookshelf, (2nd Edition). Grupo GEN, 2025.\n3. ZUGAIB, Marcelo (ed). Zugaib Obstetrícia. 4. ed. Barueri, Manole, 2023.\n4. CUNNINGHAM, F. G. et al. Obstetrícia de Williams, 24 ed. AMGH, 2016.\n5. WHO – World Health Organization. WHO recommendations: intrapartum care for a\npositive childbirth experience. Geneva: World Health Organization; 2018. Licence: CC BY-\nNC-SA 3.0 IGO.\n6. LAGREW, D.C.; LOW, L.K.; BRENNAN, R. et al. National Partnership for Maternal Safety:\nConsensus Bundle on Safe Reduction of Primary Cesarean Births-Supporting Intended\nVaginal Births. Obstet Gynecol 2018; 131:503.\n7. REVEIZ, L.; GAITÁN, H.G.; CUERVO, L.G. Enemas during labour. Cochrane Database Syst\nRev 2013; :CD000330.\n8. BASEVI, V.; LAVENDER, T. Routine perineal shaving on admission in labour. Cochrane\nDatabase Syst Rev 2014; :CD001236.\n9. LAWRENCE, A.; LEWIS, L.; HOFMEYR, G.J.; STYLES, C. Maternal positions and mobility\nduring first stage labour. Cochrane Database Syst Rev 2013; :CD003934.\n10. BONET, M.; OTA, E.; CHIBUEZE, C.E.; OLADAPO, O. T. Routine antibiotic prophylaxis after\nnormal vaginal birth for reducing maternal infectious morbidity. Cochrane Database Syst\nRev 2017; 11:CD012137.\n6. Assistência ao Parto\nExtensivo - Obstetrícia \t409/411\nT.ME/MEDOPEN - ACERVO MÉDICO GRATUITO\n\n11. LUMBIGANON, P.; THINKHAMROP, J.; THINKHAMROP, B.; TOLOSA, J. E. Vaginal\nchlorhexidine during labour for preventing maternal and neonatal infections (excluding\nGroup B Streptococcal and HIV). Cochrane Database Syst Rev 2014; :CD004070.\n12. GUPTA, J.K.; SOOD, A.; HOFMEYR, G.J.; VOGEL, J. P. Position in the second stage of\nlabour for women without epidural anaesthesia. Cochrane Database Syst Rev 2017;\n5:CD002006.\n13. WALKER, K.F.; KIBUKA, M.; THORNTON, J.G.; JONES, N. W. Maternal position in the\nsecond stage of labour for women with epidural anaesthesia. Cochrane Database Syst Rev\n2018; 11:CD008070.\n14. SMYTH, R.M.; MARKHAM, C.; DOWSWELL, T. Amniotomy for shortening spontaneous\nlabour. Cochrane Database Syst Rev 2013; :CD006167.\n15. DOWNE, S.; GYTE, G.M.; DAHLEN, H.G.; SINGATA, M. Routine vaginal examinations for\nassessing progress of labour to improve outcomes for women and babies at term. Cochrane\nDatabase Syst Rev 2013; ",
