      "https://bxedpdmgvgatjdfxgxij.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/questoes/revalida/2023/primigesta-21-anos-26-semanas-de-gestacao-procura-o-pronto-a-01.webp"
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "A",
