      "https://bxedpdmgvgatjdfxgxij.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/questoes/revalida/2014/uma-gestante-com-27-anos-de-idade-tercigesta-com-antecedente-01.webp"
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "B",
